{"seq":2,"slug":"higher-order-functions","title":"高阶函数与闭包","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typed-functional-programming/foundations/higher-order-functions","wordCount":1044,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"高阶函数与闭包\">高阶函数与闭包</h1><p>将函数视为值——可以赋给变量、作为参数传递、作为返回值返回——是函数式编程最具杠杆效应的特性。这一简单的提升打开了一扇门：程序不再只是「数据的加工流水线」，而是「可以加工加工流水线本身的元工厂」。高阶函数（Higher-Order Function, HOF）就是接受函数作为参数或返回函数作为结果的函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>高阶函数的核心洞察：函数本身是一种值，可以被存储、传递、组合。这使得「行为」和「数据」享有相同的地位——你可以对行为做所有你对数据做的事情：存在集合中、动态选择、作为配置参数传入。闭包为此提供了实现机制：函数在被传递时携带了它所需的环境。</p>\n<h2 id=\"高阶函数的分类与语义\">高阶函数的分类与语义</h2><p>高阶函数按其行为可分为三大族：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    HOF[高阶函数]&#10;    HOF --&gt; Transform[转换族]&#10;    HOF --&gt; Filter[过滤族]&#10;    HOF --&gt; Reduce[归约族]&#10;    Transform --&gt; map[&quot;map: A→B 逐元素映射&quot;]&#10;    Transform --&gt; flatMap[flatMap: A→F[B] 映射后展平&quot;]&#10;    Filter --&gt; filter[&quot;filter: A→Bool 保留满足条件者&quot;]&#10;    Filter --&gt; partition[&quot;partition: 按条件分两组&quot;]&#10;    Reduce --&gt; fold[&quot;fold/reduce: 聚合为单值&quot;]&#10;    Reduce --&gt; scan[&quot;scan: 保留中间聚合结果&quot;]\">graph TD\n    HOF[高阶函数]\n    HOF --&gt; Transform[转换族]\n    HOF --&gt; Filter[过滤族]\n    HOF --&gt; Reduce[归约族]\n    Transform --&gt; map[\"map: A→B 逐元素映射\"]\n    Transform --&gt; flatMap[flatMap: A→F[B] 映射后展平\"]\n    Filter --&gt; filter[\"filter: A→Bool 保留满足条件者\"]\n    Filter --&gt; partition[\"partition: 按条件分两组\"]\n    Reduce --&gt; fold[\"fold/reduce: 聚合为单值\"]\n    Reduce --&gt; scan[\"scan: 保留中间聚合结果\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>族</th>\n<th>代表函数</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>类型签名（伪代码）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>转换</td>\n<td><code>map</code></td>\n<td>逐元素变换，保持结构</td>\n<td><code>(A → B) → F[A] → F[B]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转换</td>\n<td><code>flatMap</code></td>\n<td>变换后展平一层结构</td>\n<td><code>(A → F[B]) → F[A] → F[B]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过滤</td>\n<td><code>filter</code></td>\n<td>保留满足谓词的元素</td>\n<td><code>(A → Bool) → F[A] → F[A]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归约</td>\n<td><code>foldLeft</code></td>\n<td>左折叠为单值</td>\n<td><code>(B, A → B) → B → F[A] → B</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归约</td>\n<td><code>scan</code></td>\n<td>保留每一步中间结果</td>\n<td><code>(B, A → B) → B → F[A] → F[B]</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些函数在几乎所有现代语言中都有对应物：JavaScript 的 <code>Array.prototype.map/filter/reduce</code>、Rust 的 <code>Iterator</code> trait、Kotlin 的 collection extensions、Scala 的标准库。掌握它们意味着掌握了跨语言的通用抽象词汇。</p>\n<h2 id=\"闭包-捕获环境的函数\">闭包：捕获环境的函数</h2><p>闭包（Closure）是一个函数与其<strong>词法作用域中被捕获的变量</strong>的组合体。当一个内层函数引用了外层函数的变量并被返回时，这些变量的生命周期被延长——它们「闭合」在函数内部。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function makeAdder(x: number): (y: number) =&gt; number {&#10;  // x 被闭包捕获，生命周期延伸到 makeAdder 返回之后&#10;  return (y: number) =&gt; x + y;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const add5 = makeAdder(5);&#10;add5(3); // 8 — x=5 仍然可访问&#10;add5(7); // 12\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> makeAdder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // x 被闭包捕获，生命周期延伸到 makeAdder 返回之后</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> y;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> add5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> makeAdder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 8 — x=5 仍然可访问</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 12</span></span></code></pre></div><p>闭包是实现以下模式的基础：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>部分应用（Partial Application）</strong>：固定部分参数，生成特化版本</li>\n<li><strong>工厂函数</strong>：根据配置生成具有不同行为的函数</li>\n<li><strong>延迟计算</strong>：将计算与其依赖的数据打包，稍后执行</li>\n<li><strong>封装状态</strong>：在纯 FP 中模拟有状态对象（尽管通常更推荐用不可变数据）</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"柯里化与部分应用\">柯里化与部分应用</h2><p>柯里化（Currying）将一个接受多参数的函数转换为一系列接受单参数的函数链。部分应用是柯里化的自然结果——传入部分参数得到一个等待剩余参数的新函数。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"-- Haskell 中所有函数默认柯里化&#10;add :: Int -&gt; Int -&gt; Int&#10;add x y = x + y&#10;&#10;-- 部分应用：固定第一个参数&#10;add5 :: Int -&gt; Int&#10;add5 = add 5&#10;&#10;-- 使用&#10;result = add5 3  -- 8\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- Haskell 中所有函数默认柯里化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>add :: Int -> Int -> Int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>add x y = x + y</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 部分应用：固定第一个参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>add5 :: Int -> Int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>add5 = add 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>result = add5 3  -- 8</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// TypeScript 手动柯里化&#10;const multiply = (a: number) =&gt; (b: number) =&gt; a * b;&#10;const double = multiply(2);&#10;const triple = multiply(3);&#10;&#10;double(5); // 10&#10;triple(5); // 15\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// TypeScript 手动柯里化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> multiply</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> double</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> multiply</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> triple</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> multiply</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">double</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">triple</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 15</span></span></code></pre></div><p>柯里化的价值在于：它让每个函数都可以作为「管道组件」被组合。当函数只接受一个参数时，函数组合 <code>f . g</code> 的类型对齐变得自然——输出类型匹配输入类型即可串联。</p>\n<h2 id=\"函数组合\">函数组合</h2><p>函数组合（Function Composition）是将两个函数串联为一个新函数的操作：<code>(f ∘ g)(x) = f(g(x))</code>。这是 FP 中构建复杂逻辑的核心手段——不是通过继承层次或设计模式，而是通过将小函数组合为大函数。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// pipe: 从左到右组合&#10;const pipe =&#10;  &lt;A, B, C&gt;(f: (a: A) =&gt; B, g: (b: B) =&gt; C) =&gt;&#10;  (a: A): C =&gt;&#10;    g(f(a));&#10;&#10;const parseAndDouble = pipe(&#10;  (s: string) =&gt; parseInt(s, 10),&#10;  (n: number) =&gt; n * 2,&#10;);&#10;&#10;parseAndDouble(&#39;21&#39;); // 42\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// pipe: 从左到右组合</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pipe</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">C</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">f</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">g</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> C</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> C</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(a));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> parseAndDouble</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> pipe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parseInt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(s, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parseAndDouble</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'21'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 42</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在 Haskell 中，<code>.</code> 运算符就是函数组合；在 Scala 中用 <code>andThen</code>/<code>compose</code>；在 TypeScript 的 Effect 库中用 <code>pipe</code>。无论语法如何变化，语义始终是：<strong>将两个或多个函数的输入输出类型对齐，构造新函数</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"point-free-风格与可读性权衡\">Point-free 风格与可读性权衡</h2><p>当函数完全通过组合其他函数来定义、不显式提及参数时，称为 point-free（无点）风格：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"-- Point-free&#10;sumOfSquares = sum . map (^2)&#10;&#10;-- 等价的有参数写法&#10;sumOfSquares xs = sum (map (^2) xs)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- Point-free</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sumOfSquares = sum . map (^2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 等价的有参数写法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sumOfSquares xs = sum (map (^2) xs)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Point-free 风格的优势是突出数据流的结构，劣势是过度使用时变得难以阅读。工程实践中的经验法则：当组合链清晰表达意图时用 point-free，当中间步骤需要命名才能理解时保留参数名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>高阶函数将函数提升为可传递的值，map/filter/fold 是跨语言的通用词汇</li>\n<li>闭包通过捕获词法环境实现部分应用、工厂、延迟计算</li>\n<li>柯里化让函数天然适配组合；函数组合是构建复杂逻辑的核心手段</li>\n<li>Point-free 风格凸显数据流，但应平衡可读性</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"lambda-calculus-referential-transparency\">Lambda 演算与引用透明</a> — 高阶函数的理论根基</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../haskell-pure-functional/abstractions/functors-applicatives\">Haskell hub：Functor 与 Applicative</a> — 将高阶函数抽象为 typeclass 层面的统一接口</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高阶函数与闭包","id":"高阶函数与闭包"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"高阶函数的分类与语义","id":"高阶函数的分类与语义"},{"level":2,"text":"闭包：捕获环境的函数","id":"闭包-捕获环境的函数"},{"level":2,"text":"柯里化与部分应用","id":"柯里化与部分应用"},{"level":2,"text":"函数组合","id":"函数组合"},{"level":2,"text":"Point-free 风格与可读性权衡","id":"point-free-风格与可读性权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"纯函数与不可变性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typed-functional-programming/foundations/pure-functions-immutability"},"next":{"title":"Lambda 演算与引用透明","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typed-functional-programming/foundations/lambda-calculus-referential-transparency"}}